# =============================================================
# .gitignore — Sendero AR (Unity 2022.3.62f3)
# Última actualización: 22 de Mayo 2026
# =============================================================

# =============================================================
# UNITY ENGINE - Generated Folders
# =============================================================
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

# =============================================================
# UNITY ENGINE - Generated Files
# =============================================================
# Asset meta data should NOT be ignored (versioned by Git)
# But these intermediates should:
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
sysinfo.txt

# Crashlytics generated file
crashlytics-build.properties

# Packed Addressables
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*

# Temporary auto-generated Android Assets
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# =============================================================
# SENDERO AR - Critical Exclusion: Art Folder
# =============================================================
# Contiene modelos 3D, audios TTS, texturas pesadas y sprites de UI.
# Demasiado pesado para Git.
Assets/_SenderoAR/Art/
Assets/_SenderoAR/Art.meta

# === Sprint 1 — AR Image Tracking sources ===
# Las imágenes crudas de tracking (placeholder_marker.png) viven 
# en Assets/_SenderoAR/Art/Tracking/ y heredan la exclusión superior.
#
# EXCEPCIÓN CRÍTICA: La base de datos compilada (SenderoTrackingLibrary.asset)
# vive en Assets/_SenderoAR/AR/Libraries/ y SÍ se commitea.

